  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of bilateral research cooperation 2018</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rdering av bilateralt forskningssamarbete 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sidas bilaterala forskningssamarbete har utvecklats gradvis under de senaste decennierna. Modellen best&#xe5;r numera av st&#xf6;d till forskningsadministration, infratruktur f&#xf6;r forskning (laboratorier, ICT, bibliotek) samt forskarutbildning, bland annat som del av forskningssamarbeten. Det finns ett behov av att utv&#xe4;rdera modellen med tanke p&#xe5; dess effektivitet, kvalitet, effekter och h&#xe5;llbarhet. Utv&#xe4;rderingen syftar till att bidra till den fortsatta utvecklingen av svenskt bilateralt forskningssamarbete som ett verktyg f&#xf6;r svenskt utvecklingssamarbete.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida&#x2019;s bilateral research cooperation has gradually evolved over the last decades. The model now includes support to: research management; research infrastructure such as laboratories and equipment; access to scientific information (ICT and libraries); and research training as part of collaborative projects. There is a need to evaluate the model, in terms of effectiveness, quality, impact and sustainability. The purpose of the evaluation is to serve as an input to the development of Swedish bilateral research cooperation as a modality for development cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
